WEBVTT

00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:30.062
(Laughter)

00:02:30.062 --> 00:02:31.939
and it's a silent judgment.

00:02:32.773 --> 00:02:33.774
And to those people,

00:02:33.774 --> 00:02:37.028
I respond with a quote from this Brooklyn
poet you may have heard of,

00:02:37.028 --> 00:02:38.029
Jay-Z.

00:02:38.029 --> 00:02:39.030
(Laughter)

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.157
“She get it from her mama.”

00:02:42.074 --> 00:02:43.075
I am she,

00:02:43.075 --> 00:02:47.121
and my mama is the epitome
of a grown-ass woman:

00:02:47.121 --> 00:02:50.249
someone who has always
been very comfortable in her skin.

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:54.045
In 1965, my mom was 37 years old.

00:02:54.045 --> 00:02:55.296
She already had one child,

00:02:55.296 --> 00:02:57.006
my big brother, Gerry,

00:02:57.006 --> 00:03:00.134
and she married my dad,
but she kept her maiden name.